{"id":"conv_03540","context":"Final reflection on the science-and-society unit with the whole class","ambient":"lecture_hall_quiet","cast":["asuka_teacher","ren_uni","sakura_teen"],"tier":3,"lines":[{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Well then, looking back on this term's science and society unit, please share your reflections with me.","jp":"それでは、今学期の科学と社会のユニットを振り返って、皆さんの考察を聞かせてください。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,5,9,87,156,196,245,564,661,1017,1414,2196,3517,3735,4749,5104,5281,5282,5312,5742,6361,8041,8469,14568,18438],"jpTokens":[{"s":"それでは","w":2196},{"s":"、"},{"s":"今","r":"こん","w":87},{"s":"学期","r":"がっき","w":5742},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"科学","r":"かがく","w":564},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"社会","r":"しゃかい","w":156},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"ユニット","w":5282},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"振り返っ","r":"ふりかえっ","w":6361},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"皆さん","r":"みなさん","w":661},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"考察","r":"こうさつ","w":3517},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"聞か","r":"きか","w":1017},{"s":"せ","w":245},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"ください","w":4749},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"For me, what was striking was that the axis of our discussion was 'the impact technology brings to society.'","jp":"僕は議論の軸が「技術が社会にもたらす影響」だったのが印象的でした。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,6,8,17,21,34,73,82,117,156,214,261,474,516,1009,3477,3511,4781,5711],"jpTokens":[{"s":"僕","r":"ぼく","w":214},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"議論","r":"ぎろん","w":516},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"軸","r":"じく","w":3511},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"「"},{"s":"技術","r":"ぎじゅつ","w":261},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"社会","r":"しゃかい","w":156},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"もたらす","w":3477},{"s":"影響","r":"えいきょう","w":474},{"s":"」"},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"印象","r":"いんしょう","w":1009},{"s":"的","r":"てき","w":34},{"s":"でし","w":17},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sakura_teen","mood":null,"en":"Yeah, especially the talk about gene editing, and how even human traits could be changed, was a bit scary.","jp":"うん、特に遺伝子の編集とか、人の特性まで変えられるって話、ちょっと怖かった。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,8,30,52,84,100,128,170,172,197,284,848,1089,2098,2488,2917,3460,3561,3839,12234],"jpTokens":[{"s":"うん","w":2917},{"s":"、"},{"s":"特に","r":"とくに","w":284},{"s":"遺伝子","r":"いでんし","w":3460},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"編集","r":"へんしゅう","w":848},{"s":"とか","w":172},{"s":"、"},{"s":"人","r":"ひと","w":30},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"特性","r":"とくせい","w":3561},{"s":"まで","w":52},{"s":"変え","r":"かえ","w":2098},{"s":"られる","w":170},{"s":"って","w":100},{"s":"話","r":"はなし","w":128},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ちょっと","w":197},{"s":"怖かっ","r":"こわかっ","w":2488},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"That's right. The point that the same research could lead to medicine or to weapons was an important one.","jp":"そうですね。同じ研究が医療にも兵器にもつながり得る、という点は重要でしたね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,3,6,8,11,17,32,51,117,151,162,200,347,758,1006,1999,3154,3525,4781,5004,6786,9151],"jpTokens":[{"s":"そうですね","w":6786},{"s":"。"},{"s":"同じ","r":"おなじ","w":162},{"s":"研究","r":"けんきゅう","w":200},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"医療","r":"いりょう","w":758},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"兵器","r":"へいき","w":3525},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"つながり","w":3154},{"s":"得る","r":"える","w":1006},{"s":"、"},{"s":"という","w":32},{"s":"点","r":"てん","w":151},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"重要","r":"じゅうよう","w":347},{"s":"でし","w":17},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Precisely for that reason, I felt we also need a perspective that holds doubt toward scientists' motives.","jp":"だからこそ、科学者の動機に疑いを持つ視点も必要だと感じました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,5,8,9,11,14,21,28,45,116,558,564,985,1507,3577,4326,4447,4781],"jpTokens":[{"s":"だからこそ","w":4447},{"s":"、"},{"s":"科学","r":"かがく","w":564},{"s":"者","r":"しゃ","w":45},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"動機","r":"どうき","w":4326},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"疑い","r":"うたがい","w":3577},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"持つ","r":"もつ","w":558},{"s":"視点","r":"してん","w":1507},{"s":"も","w":11},{"